Object.assign(WORDS.ko, {"3D Builder": "3D 빌더", "My 3D game": "나의 3D 게임", "Expert mode": "전문가 모드", "Build a real 3D game piece by piece — place, move, turn and size every block, add enemies, bosses and rules, then play it with your own hero.": "진짜 3D 게임을 한 조각씩 만들어요 — 블록마다 놓고, 옮기고, 돌리고, 크기를 바꾸고, 적·보스·규칙을 넣은 뒤 내 영웅으로 직접 플레이해요.", "How to use — ARON, LUMI and NEX show you": "사용법 — ARON, LUMI, NEX가 알려줘요", "Start a new 3D game": "새 3D 게임 시작", "Blank 3D": "빈 3D", "A start pad and a goal — you build the rest": "시작 발판과 골인 지점만 — 나머지는 직접 만들어요", "Obby course": "장애물 코스", "Jumps, lava, spinners and checkpoints": "점프, 용암, 회전 장애물, 체크포인트", "Combat arena": "전투 아레나", "Enemies and a boss — knock them all out to win": "적과 보스 — 모두 쓰러뜨리면 승리", "Race track": "레이스 트랙", "Rings in order and laps, on a hoverboard": "순서대로 링 통과, 여러 바퀴, 호버보드로", "Explore world": "탐험 월드", "Hills, pools and gems to find": "언덕, 연못, 찾아야 할 보석", "Keep building": "이어서 만들기", "Draft": "임시 저장", "Tip: a computer with a mouse is the easiest place to build; on a phone hold it sideways.": "팁: 마우스가 있는 컴퓨터에서 만들기가 가장 편해요. 폰에서는 가로로 들어 주세요.", "3D Builder guide": "3D 빌더 가이드", "Start building": "만들기 시작", "Welcome to the 3D Builder!": "3D 빌더에 온 걸 환영해!", "I'm ARON. Here you make a real 3D game: blocks, ramps, lava, enemies and bosses. Everything you place is played with your own hero — let's build one together!": "나는 ARON이야. 여기서는 진짜 3D 게임을 만들어: 블록, 경사로, 용암, 적, 보스까지. 놓은 건 전부 네 영웅으로 직접 플레이할 수 있어 — 같이 하나 만들어 보자!", "1 · Pick how to start": "1 · 시작 방법 고르기", "Blank 3D gives you just a start pad and a goal. Obby, Combat, Race and Explore start you with a ready course — change anything you like. You can't break it: Undo is always there.": "빈 3D는 시작 발판과 골인 지점만 줘요. 장애물·전투·레이스·탐험은 완성된 코스로 시작해서 마음대로 바꿀 수 있어요. 망가질 걱정은 없어요: 되돌리기가 항상 있으니까요.", "2 · Look around": "2 · 둘러보기", "Drag empty space to turn the view, use the wheel (or pinch) to zoom, right-drag (or two fingers) to slide. Press Focus to fly to the piece you picked.": "빈 곳을 드래그하면 시점이 돌아가고, 휠(또는 두 손가락 벌리기)로 확대해. 오른쪽 드래그(또는 두 손가락)로 옆으로 밀고, 포커스를 누르면 고른 조각으로 날아가.", "3 · Place pieces": "3 · 조각 놓기", "The pieces are on the left: blocks, ramps, lava, jump pads, coins, checkpoints, enemies, a boss, doors and buttons… Tap one and it drops in front of you.": "왼쪽에 조각들이 있어: 블록, 경사로, 용암, 점프 패드, 코인, 체크포인트, 적, 보스, 문과 버튼… 하나를 누르면 내 앞에 떨어져.", "4 · Move, turn and size": "4 · 옮기기, 돌리기, 크기", "Tap a piece to pick it. Move (W) drags the arrows, Turn (E) the ring, Size (R) the little cubes. Snap keeps it on the grid, Copy makes a twin, Delete removes it. Shift + click picks several.": "조각을 눌러 고르세요. 이동(W)은 화살표를, 회전(E)은 링을, 크기(R)는 작은 큐브를 드래그해요. 스냅은 격자에 맞추고, 복사는 쌍둥이를 만들고, 삭제는 지워요. Shift + 클릭으로 여러 개를 골라요.", "5 · Make it smart": "5 · 똑똑하게 만들기", "Properties sets the picked piece. Game sets the genre, how to win, gravity and laps. Logic says WHEN something happens THEN what — a button opens a door, the boss falls and you win.": "속성은 고른 조각을 설정해. 게임 탭은 장르, 승리 조건, 중력, 바퀴 수를 정해. 로직은 언제 무슨 일이 일어나면 무엇을 할지 정해 — 버튼이 문을 열고, 보스가 쓰러지면 승리처럼.", "6 · Test it": "6 · 테스트하기", "Press Test from here and play it as your hero. The 40 test players show how many reach the goal, and red boxes mark spots nobody can reach — move those pieces closer.": "여기서 테스트를 눌러 내 영웅으로 플레이해 봐. 테스트 플레이어 40명이 몇 명이 골인하는지 보여주고, 빨간 상자는 아무도 닿지 못하는 곳이야 — 그 조각을 더 가까이 옮겨.", "7 · Make it pretty and ask for help": "7 · 꾸미고 도움 받기", "Look & UI changes the sky, the light and what's on screen. The Director takes words: “add a boss at the end”, “make it easier”. Assets holds ready-made pieces and prefabs.": "룩 & UI에서 하늘, 조명, 화면 표시를 바꿔요. 디렉터에게는 말로 부탁해요: “끝에 보스 넣어줘”, “더 쉽게 해줘”. 에셋에는 완성된 조각과 프리팹이 있어요.", "8 · Save and publish": "8 · 저장하고 게시하기", "Done brings you back to Create: Save keeps a draft, Publish puts it in the Creator Arcade and in ARCIRCLE WORLD, where everyone can play it — and race you live.": "완료를 누르면 만들기로 돌아와. 저장은 임시 저장, 게시는 크리에이터 아케이드와 ARCIRCLE WORLD에 올려서 모두가 플레이하고 너와 실시간 레이스도 할 수 있어."});
Object.assign(WORDS.zh, {"3D Builder": "3D 建造器", "My 3D game": "我的 3D 游戏", "Expert mode": "专家模式", "Build a real 3D game piece by piece — place, move, turn and size every block, add enemies, bosses and rules, then play it with your own hero.": "一块一块地打造真正的 3D 游戏——放置、移动、旋转并缩放每个方块，加入敌人、首领和规则，再用你自己的英雄来玩。", "How to use — ARON, LUMI and NEX show you": "使用方法——ARON、LUMI 和 NEX 来教你", "Start a new 3D game": "开始新的 3D 游戏", "Blank 3D": "空白 3D", "A start pad and a goal — you build the rest": "只有起点平台和终点——其余由你建造", "Obby course": "障碍赛道", "Jumps, lava, spinners and checkpoints": "跳跃、熔岩、旋转障碍和检查点", "Combat arena": "战斗竞技场", "Enemies and a boss — knock them all out to win": "敌人和首领——全部击倒即可获胜", "Race track": "竞速赛道", "Rings in order and laps, on a hoverboard": "按顺序穿过光环、多圈、乘悬浮板", "Explore world": "探索世界", "Hills, pools and gems to find": "山丘、水池和待寻找的宝石", "Keep building": "继续建造", "Draft": "草稿", "Tip: a computer with a mouse is the easiest place to build; on a phone hold it sideways.": "提示：用带鼠标的电脑建造最方便；在手机上请横屏。", "3D Builder guide": "3D 建造器指南", "Start building": "开始建造", "Welcome to the 3D Builder!": "欢迎来到 3D 建造器！", "I'm ARON. Here you make a real 3D game: blocks, ramps, lava, enemies and bosses. Everything you place is played with your own hero — let's build one together!": "我是 ARON。在这里你可以做出真正的 3D 游戏：方块、斜坡、熔岩、敌人和首领。你放的一切都能用你自己的英雄来玩——我们一起做一个吧！", "1 · Pick how to start": "1 · 选择开始方式", "Blank 3D gives you just a start pad and a goal. Obby, Combat, Race and Explore start you with a ready course — change anything you like. You can't break it: Undo is always there.": "空白 3D 只给你起点平台和终点。障碍、战斗、竞速和探索会给你一条现成的赛道——随意修改。不用担心弄坏：随时可以撤销。", "2 · Look around": "2 · 四处看看", "Drag empty space to turn the view, use the wheel (or pinch) to zoom, right-drag (or two fingers) to slide. Press Focus to fly to the piece you picked.": "拖动空白处旋转视角，滚轮（或双指捏合）缩放，右键拖动（或双指）平移。按“聚焦”可飞到你选中的部件。", "3 · Place pieces": "3 · 放置部件", "The pieces are on the left: blocks, ramps, lava, jump pads, coins, checkpoints, enemies, a boss, doors and buttons… Tap one and it drops in front of you.": "部件在左侧：方块、斜坡、熔岩、弹跳板、金币、检查点、敌人、首领、门和按钮……点一下它就会落在你面前。", "4 · Move, turn and size": "4 · 移动、旋转和缩放", "Tap a piece to pick it. Move (W) drags the arrows, Turn (E) the ring, Size (R) the little cubes. Snap keeps it on the grid, Copy makes a twin, Delete removes it. Shift + click picks several.": "点一个部件来选中它。移动（W）拖动箭头，旋转（E）拖动圆环，缩放（R）拖动小方块。吸附让它对齐网格，复制做出一个双胞胎，删除将它移除。Shift + 点击可多选。", "5 · Make it smart": "5 · 让它更聪明", "Properties sets the picked piece. Game sets the genre, how to win, gravity and laps. Logic says WHEN something happens THEN what — a button opens a door, the boss falls and you win.": "属性设置选中的部件。游戏页设置类型、获胜方式、重力和圈数。逻辑写“当某事发生时就做什么”——按钮打开门，首领倒下你就赢了。", "6 · Test it": "6 · 测试一下", "Press Test from here and play it as your hero. The 40 test players show how many reach the goal, and red boxes mark spots nobody can reach — move those pieces closer.": "按“从这里测试”，用你的英雄来玩。40 名测试玩家会显示多少人到达终点，红框标出无人能到达的位置——把那些部件挪近一点。", "7 · Make it pretty and ask for help": "7 · 美化并寻求帮助", "Look & UI changes the sky, the light and what's on screen. The Director takes words: “add a boss at the end”, “make it easier”. Assets holds ready-made pieces and prefabs.": "外观与界面可改变天空、光线和屏幕显示。导演听得懂话：“在结尾加个首领”、“让它更简单”。资源里有现成的部件和预制件。", "8 · Save and publish": "8 · 保存并发布", "Done brings you back to Create: Save keeps a draft, Publish puts it in the Creator Arcade and in ARCIRCLE WORLD, where everyone can play it — and race you live.": "完成会带你回到创作：保存会留下草稿，发布会把它放进创作者街机和 ARCIRCLE WORLD，所有人都能玩——还能和你实时竞速。"});
Object.assign(WORDS.tr, {"3D Builder": "3D Oluşturucu", "My 3D game": "3D oyunum", "Expert mode": "Uzman modu", "Build a real 3D game piece by piece — place, move, turn and size every block, add enemies, bosses and rules, then play it with your own hero.": "Gerçek bir 3D oyunu parça parça kur — her bloğu yerleştir, taşı, döndür ve boyutlandır, düşman, boss ve kurallar ekle, sonra kendi kahramanınla oyna.", "How to use — ARON, LUMI and NEX show you": "Nasıl kullanılır — ARON, LUMI ve NEX gösteriyor", "Start a new 3D game": "Yeni bir 3D oyun başlat", "Blank 3D": "Boş 3D", "A start pad and a goal — you build the rest": "Bir başlangıç platformu ve bir hedef — gerisini sen kur", "Obby course": "Engel parkuru", "Jumps, lava, spinners and checkpoints": "Zıplamalar, lav, dönen engeller ve kontrol noktaları", "Combat arena": "Savaş arenası", "Enemies and a boss — knock them all out to win": "Düşmanlar ve bir boss — hepsini yen, kazan", "Race track": "Yarış pisti", "Rings in order and laps, on a hoverboard": "Sırayla halkalar ve turlar, hoverboard ile", "Explore world": "Keşif dünyası", "Hills, pools and gems to find": "Tepeler, havuzlar ve bulunacak mücevherler", "Keep building": "Kurmaya devam et", "Draft": "Taslak", "Tip: a computer with a mouse is the easiest place to build; on a phone hold it sideways.": "İpucu: kurmak için en kolay yer fareli bir bilgisayar; telefonda yan tut.", "3D Builder guide": "3D Oluşturucu rehberi", "Start building": "Kurmaya başla", "Welcome to the 3D Builder!": "3D Oluşturucu'ya hoş geldin!", "I'm ARON. Here you make a real 3D game: blocks, ramps, lava, enemies and bosses. Everything you place is played with your own hero — let's build one together!": "Ben ARON. Burada gerçek bir 3D oyun yaparsın: bloklar, rampalar, lav, düşmanlar ve bosslar. Koyduğun her şeyi kendi kahramanınla oynarsın — hadi birlikte bir tane yapalım!", "1 · Pick how to start": "1 · Nasıl başlayacağını seç", "Blank 3D gives you just a start pad and a goal. Obby, Combat, Race and Explore start you with a ready course — change anything you like. You can't break it: Undo is always there.": "Boş 3D sana yalnızca bir başlangıç platformu ve hedef verir. Engel, Savaş, Yarış ve Keşif hazır bir parkurla başlatır — istediğini değiştir. Bozamazsın: Geri al her zaman orada.", "2 · Look around": "2 · Etrafına bak", "Drag empty space to turn the view, use the wheel (or pinch) to zoom, right-drag (or two fingers) to slide. Press Focus to fly to the piece you picked.": "Görüşü çevirmek için boş alanı sürükle, yakınlaştırmak için tekerlek (veya iki parmak), kaydırmak için sağ tık sürükle (veya iki parmak). Seçtiğin parçaya uçmak için Odakla'ya bas.", "3 · Place pieces": "3 · Parça yerleştir", "The pieces are on the left: blocks, ramps, lava, jump pads, coins, checkpoints, enemies, a boss, doors and buttons… Tap one and it drops in front of you.": "Parçalar solda: bloklar, rampalar, lav, zıplama pedleri, paralar, kontrol noktaları, düşmanlar, boss, kapılar ve düğmeler… Birine dokun, önüne düşsün.", "4 · Move, turn and size": "4 · Taşı, döndür, boyutlandır", "Tap a piece to pick it. Move (W) drags the arrows, Turn (E) the ring, Size (R) the little cubes. Snap keeps it on the grid, Copy makes a twin, Delete removes it. Shift + click picks several.": "Seçmek için bir parçaya dokun. Taşı (W) okları, Döndür (E) halkayı, Boyut (R) küçük küpleri sürükler. Hizala ızgaraya oturtur, Kopyala ikizini yapar, Sil kaldırır. Shift + tıklama birkaçını seçer.", "5 · Make it smart": "5 · Akıllı yap", "Properties sets the picked piece. Game sets the genre, how to win, gravity and laps. Logic says WHEN something happens THEN what — a button opens a door, the boss falls and you win.": "Özellikler seçili parçayı ayarlar. Oyun sekmesi türü, kazanma şeklini, yerçekimini ve turları belirler. Mantık NE ZAMAN bir şey olursa O ZAMAN ne olacağını söyler — düğme kapıyı açar, boss düşer ve kazanırsın.", "6 · Test it": "6 · Test et", "Press Test from here and play it as your hero. The 40 test players show how many reach the goal, and red boxes mark spots nobody can reach — move those pieces closer.": "Buradan test et'e bas ve kahramanınla oyna. 40 test oyuncusu kaçının hedefe ulaştığını gösterir, kırmızı kutular kimsenin ulaşamadığı yerleri işaretler — o parçaları yaklaştır.", "7 · Make it pretty and ask for help": "7 · Güzelleştir ve yardım iste", "Look & UI changes the sky, the light and what's on screen. The Director takes words: “add a boss at the end”, “make it easier”. Assets holds ready-made pieces and prefabs.": "Görünüm ve Arayüz gökyüzünü, ışığı ve ekrandakileri değiştirir. Yönetmen sözlerini anlar: “sona bir boss ekle”, “daha kolay yap”. Varlıklar'da hazır parçalar ve prefabrikler var.", "8 · Save and publish": "8 · Kaydet ve yayınla", "Done brings you back to Create: Save keeps a draft, Publish puts it in the Creator Arcade and in ARCIRCLE WORLD, where everyone can play it — and race you live.": "Tamam seni Oluştur'a geri götürür: Kaydet taslak tutar, Yayınla onu Creator Arcade'e ve ARCIRCLE WORLD'e koyar; herkes oynayabilir — ve seninle canlı yarışabilir."});
